      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 741693579,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The definition in IEEE 802.1X (2010, 2020):\n\n- 0 if MACsec is not implemented,\n- 1 if ‘Integrity without confidentiality’,\n- 2 if ‘Integrity without confidentiality’ and ‘Integrity and confidentiality’ with a confidentiality offset of 0,\n- 3 if ‘Integrity without confidentiality’ and ‘Integrity and confidentiality’ with a confidentiality offset of 0, 30, or 50. See IEEE Std 802.1AE.",
